  "explanation": {
    "body": "Its forecast takes this form: direction, over 20 sessions. It is graded on the size and direction of the gap between its forecast and what actually happens. It would be ended if a leg is retired independently if its median confidence interval includes zero after 150 episodes. It counts as proven at 150 episodes per leg.",
